Input: {"question": "What position does Jean Masson currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 11, "text": "Jean Masson"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 13, "end": 108, "text": "Jean Masson is a Roman Catholic bishop who has been serving as the Prefect of Doubs since 2015."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 109, "end": 133, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 135, "end": 196, "text": "Jean Masson was born on August 12, 1965, in Besançon, France."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 197, "end": 343, "text": "He received his early education at the Lycée Saint-Jean in Besançon and later pursued his priestly formation at the Seminary of Frasne-le-Château."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 344, "end": 417, "text": "Masson was ordained as a priest on June 29, 1991, by Bishop Lucien Daloz."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 418, "end": 424, "text": "Career"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 426, "end": 573, "text": "Masson served as a parish priest in several parishes in the Diocese of Besançon before being appointed as the Vicar General of the diocese in 2005."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 574, "end": 645, "text": "In 2010, he was elevated to the rank of Monsignor by Pope Benedict XVI."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 646, "end": 677, "text": "Appointment as Prefect of Doubs"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 679, "end": 784, "text": "On February 10, 2015, Masson was appointed as the Prefect of Doubs by French President François Hollande."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 785, "end": 951, "text": "This appointment was seen as a significant milestone in the history of the Prefecture of Doubs, as Masson became the first Roman Catholic bishop to hold the position."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 952, "end": 974, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 976, "end": 1198, "text": "A study published in the Journal of French Administrative History in 2017 noted that Masson's appointment as Prefect of Doubs marked a shift in the French government's approach to religious representation in public office."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1199, "end": 1375, "text": "The study, titled \"The Evolution of Religious Representation in French Public Office,\" highlighted Masson's role in promoting interfaith dialogue and cooperation in the region."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1376, "end": 1379, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1381, "end": 1536, "text": "In an interview with the French newspaper Le Figaro in 2018, Masson discussed his approach to governance and his commitment to serving the people of Doubs."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1537, "end": 1652, "text": "He stated, \"As a bishop and a prefect, I am committed to serving the people of Doubs with integrity and compassion."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1653, "end": 1781, "text": "I believe that my faith informs my approach to governance and helps me to make decisions that benefit the community as a whole.\""}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1782, "end": 1785, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1787, "end": 1893, "text": "A biography of Masson, titled \"Jean Masson: A Life of Service,\" was published in 2020 by Éditions du Cerf."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1894, "end": 2012, "text": "The book provides a comprehensive overview of Masson's life and career, including his appointment as Prefect of Doubs."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2013, "end": 2016, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2018, "end": 2028, "text": "References"}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2030, "end": 2044, "text": "[1] Dupont, P."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2045, "end": 2052, "text": "(2017)."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2053, "end": 2119, "text": "The Evolution of Religious Representation in French Public Office."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2120, "end": 2175, "text": "Journal of French Administrative History, 10(1), 23-45."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 75, "text": "Title: The Unassuming Assistant: The Story of Jean Masson, Auxiliary Bishop"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 77, "end": 246, "text": "In the grand tapestry of the Roman Catholic Church, there exist individuals who toil behind the scenes, their dedication and service often going unnoticed by the masses."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 247, "end": 414, "text": "One such individual is Jean Masson, a man of unwavering faith and unshakeable commitment, who has devoted his life to the service of the Church as an auxiliary bishop."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 415, "end": 554, "text": "To understand the significance of Jean Masson's role, one must first grasp the intricacies of the Catholic Church's hierarchical structure."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 555, "end": 654, "text": "At the apex of this pyramid stands the Pope, the spiritual leader of the global Catholic community."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 655, "end": 793, "text": "Beneath him lie the bishops, shepherds of their respective dioceses, responsible for guiding their flocks along the path of righteousness."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 794, "end": 903, "text": "And it is here, in the shadow of these diocesan bishops, that the auxiliary bishops like Jean Masson operate."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 904, "end": 983, "text": "An auxiliary bishop is a position of great importance, yet often misunderstood."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 984, "end": 1165, "text": "They are not mere appendages to the diocesan bishop, but rather trusted assistants, tasked with sharing the weight of responsibility and providing critical support in times of need."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1166, "end": 1296, "text": "They are the right-hand men, the confidants, and the advisors, working tirelessly to ensure the smooth functioning of the diocese."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1297, "end": 1439, "text": "Jean Masson's journey to becoming an auxiliary bishop was not one of chance, but rather the culmination of a lifetime of devotion and service."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1440, "end": 1541, "text": "Born into a devout Catholic family, Masson was instilled with a deep sense of faith from a young age."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1542, "end": 1636, "text": "As he grew, so did his desire to serve the Church, leading him to pursue a life of priesthood."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1637, "end": 1757, "text": "Years of study and dedication followed, as Masson honed his skills and deepened his understanding of the Catholic faith."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1758, "end": 1895, "text": "His unwavering commitment did not go unnoticed, and soon he found himself being considered for the esteemed position of auxiliary bishop."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1896, "end": 1956, "text": "The appointment of an auxiliary bishop is no trivial matter."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1957, "end": 2101, "text": "It requires the approval of the Pope himself, and is only granted to those who have demonstrated exceptional dedication, wisdom, and leadership."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2102, "end": 2255, "text": "Jean Masson's selection was a testament to his remarkable qualities, and a recognition of his ability to provide critical support to the diocesan bishop."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2256, "end": 2310, "text": "As auxiliary bishop, Masson's duties are multifaceted."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2311, "end": 2438, "text": "He assists the diocesan bishop in the governance of the diocese, providing counsel and guidance on matters of great importance."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "priest", "card_ids": ["d2:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Jean Masson", "scope": "Roman Catholic Church", "claim": "Jean Masson pursued a life of priesthood before becoming an auxiliary bishop.", "answer": "priest", "quote": "As he grew, so did his desire to serve the Church, leading him to pursue a life of priesthood.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Prefect of Doubs", "Auxiliary Bishop"]}
